---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Cairns Skin is an educational skin knowledge resource connected to Laser Clinics Cairns."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-5 md:px-8 py-14 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="mb-6">About Cairns Skin</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Cairns Skin exists to answer the questions people naturally ask about
      their skin, the kind of questions typed into Google or asked of an AI
      assistant late at night. Our aim is to give clear, evidence-informed
      answers first, without pushing unnecessary treatment.
    </p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      The site is connected to Laser Clinics Cairns. Where a treatment is
      genuinely relevant to a question, we explain it honestly, including
      its limitations, downtime and who it may not suit, and note where a
      consultation is the appropriate next step.
    </p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
      Content on this site is educational and does not replace individual
      medical advice. Read our <a href="/medical-disclaimer/">medical disclaimer</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
